   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Decir la fecha",
    "@en": "Say the date"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "Para decir el día del mes usamos números ordinales: **first**, **second**, **third**, **fourth**, **fifth**, **sixth**, **seventh**, **eighth**, **ninth**, **tenth**.",
     "@en": "To say the day of the month we use ordinary numbers: **first**, **second**, **third**, **fourth**, **fifth**, **sixth**, **seventh**, **eighth**, **ninth**, **tenth**."
    },
    {
     "@es": "En inglés británico es común escribir **7 July** o **7th July**; al hablar decimos normalmente **the seventh of July**. En inglés estadounidense se escribe normalmente **July 7** o **July 7th**, y se dice **July the seventh**.",
     "@en": "In British it is common to write **7 July** or **7th July**; when we speak we say **the seventh of July** normally. In American English it is usually written **July 7** or **July 7th**, and it is said **July the seventh**."
    },
    {
     "@es": "Para fechas concretas usamos **on**: **on the seventh of July**.",
     "@en": "For specific dates we use **on**: **on the seventh of July**."
    }
   ]
